From 528e08a6a02c352ee3b411d417198a1e65d687da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pokeheartgold-3ds-bootstrap <bootstrap@invalid>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 17:17:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Give every case label a statement before its declaration

GCC rejects a declaration directly under a case label with "a label can only
be part of a statement and a declaration is not a statement" (C99 6.8.1
labeled-statement is `identifier : statement`). Metrowerks accepted the
declaration as a statement, so the HGSS sources put locals there, and the
error also hides the declarations after it: weather_manager.c:2245,
launch_application.c:956, overlay_03/pokeathlon_records.c:219 and
wifi_club_app.c:1006 then report their locals undeclared.

Under SDK_PORT_3DS insert an empty statement after each label. It is a
statement, so the declarations that follow are legal and keep exactly the
same scope, initialisation and order. 38 sites in 15 files, all reached from
the host32 build's per-file logs:
  battle/battle_command.c:7215, battle/party_gauge.c:248/299/393/496/566,
  comm_state.c:1820, field/event_cutscene_celebi.c:144,
  field/event_cutscene_shaymin.c:99, field/weather_manager.c:735/741/1706/
  1749/1869/1911/2050/2090/2189/2211/2244/2271, field2d/field2d_view.c:
  535/555, field_take_photo.c:618, launch_application.c:955/1047/1079/1083/
  1087/1097/1118, map_preview_graphic.c:911, overlay_03/pokeathlon_records.c:
  218, pokeathlon/pokeathlon_box.c:99, render_text.c:131,
  scrcmd_link_sync.c:124, wifi_club/wifi_club_app.c:938/1005.

gcc-10 -E -P without SDK_PORT_3DS is byte-identical for all 15 files.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
